# Architecture B — admin-api is the resource server. Two local modes:
#
# 1) Vite /api proxy (default for bun run dev)
#    Leave VITE_ADMIN_API_URL unset so JSON and SSE both call /api.
#    Vite rewrites /api/* to VITE_PROXY_TARGET (local admin-api or Cloud Run).
# 2) Direct JSON origin (deployed SPA / opt-in docker compose)
#    Set VITE_ADMIN_API_URL to the real admin-api origin. Browser JSON goes
#    cross-origin. SSE stays on same-origin /api (EventSource cannot set
#    Authorization) — nginx or Vite still proxies /api/live/events.
#    Also set VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (public GIS / IAP OAuth client).
#
# Empty VITE_ADMIN_API_URL is the local + rollback / same-origin /api path.
# Do not default this file to admin-api-prod.

# VITE_ADMIN_API_URL=https://admin-api-dev-hsa55rg7ja-uk.a.run.app
# Public GIS / IAP OAuth client — not a secret. Required when the URL above is set.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=95660886550-cpdl76minmdshvi7vcchcqivkjdna3f7.apps.googleusercontent.com

VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# --- Local web → deployed admin-api-dev (Application Default Credentials) ---
# Mint a Cloud Run ID token from your user ADC (same audience as habeas-cli auth login --adc).
#
#   gcloud auth application-default login
#
# Leave VITE_ADMIN_API_URL unset. Vite injects the Bearer on /api (JSON + SSE).
# VITE_PROXY_TARGET=https://admin-api-dev-hsa55rg7ja-uk.a.run.app
#
# IAP_USER_EMAIL is optional for ADC: admin-api reads your email from the JWT when it
# matches ADMIN_API_SUPER_ADMINS. Set it only for SA impersonation fallback.
# IAP_USER_EMAIL=you@example.com
# IAP_IMPERSONATE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=95660886550-compute@developer.gserviceaccount.com
#
# Non-super_admin operators: use the ops-ia IAP front door instead:
#   https://ops-ia-web-dev-hsa55rg7ja-uk.a.run.app
#
# Optional override (must be a Cloud Run ID token for VITE_PROXY_TARGET origin):
# CLOUD_RUN_ID_TOKEN=
# Do NOT paste an IAP_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID audience token into IAP_ID_TOKEN — it will 401.
